"name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-25T18:39:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T10:22:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nConfirmed in 4.6, 4.7, 4.7.1 versions.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.31021.5001) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 31.11 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI disabled \"AutoAccceptQuit\" so I can add a confirmation window for quitting the game. I then noticed that clicking on the close button will remove the window's decoration and menu bar with actions. It is true if \"Embed game on next play\" is checked, otherwise it's false.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set \"AutoAcceptQuit\" to false.\n2. Run the game and click the close button.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Bug test project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30377391/Bug.test.project.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine